flowchart TB
    Start["Scheduled pass\nDisabled by default"] --> Lease{"Writer lease valid?"}
    Lease -->|"No"| Stop["Defer to next pass"]
    Lease -->|"Yes"| Pick["Visit at most models-per-run\nRotate through sorted catalog"]
    Pick --> Capture["Per-model serialized visit\nCreate checkpoint if revision threshold is met"]
    Capture --> Prune["Prune one bounded set of\ncovered, published payload batches"]
    Prune --> GC["Verify latest checkpoint, receipts and tail\nKeep newest configured checkpoint count"]
    GC --> Next["Continue to next model\nIsolate and log individual model failures"]
